        <span class="label">The proposition</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <h2 class="big">Most people come to the Mentawais for ten days. This is for the ones who kept thinking about it on the flight home.</h2>
        <p class="lede dim">Located in the world-famous Mentawai Islands — home to some of the most consistent and coveted surf breaks on the planet — this resort concept is designed as a low-impact coastal retreat where nature, wellness and wave-driven adventure coexist.</p>
        <a class="link" href="#/community">Inside the community</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <span class="label">Three reasons people stay</span>
    <div class="reasons">
      <article class="reason">
        <div class="bg" style="background-image:var(--photo-surf)" role="img" aria-label="A surfer driving along the face of a hollow blue wave."></div>
        <span class="rnum">In the water</span>
        <h3>Surf</h3>
        <p>Dedicated boats and local guides who read the day, not the timetable. Ten named breaks inside a short run — and the one out front works while everywhere else is still deciding.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="reason">
        <span class="rnum">Between sessions</span>
        <h3>Recover</h3>
        <p>A spa and a surf-specific gym built for the second session, not the spa brochure: cryochamber, ice bath, sauna, balance and resistance work, video analysis.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="reason">
        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Coconut palms running down to white sand and turquoise reef water.">
        <span class="rnum">On the island</span>
        <h3>Belong</h3>
        <p>Six households, chosen slowly. Solar and rainwater on site, Mentawai people on staff, and money committed to the island's airport and hospital as lots sell.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band dark">
    <div class="split">
